 *************\n\n[] (https://byu.instructure.com/courses/36994/files/13577
 519/download?download_frd=1&hidden=1)\n\n \n\n---------\n   Survey\n---
 ------\n\nEach completed pilot survey is worth approximately one extra-cre
 dit point. If you complete all of the pilot surveys\, your overall course 
 grade will increase by 2%. This bonus will be applied at the end of the se
 mester.\n\nThis course has recently been adapted for online instruction\, 
 and we would love to hear your feedback! Let us know what you like\, what 
 is confusing\, and what we might change to create a better experience for 
 students in future semesters. If anything doesn't make sense or is broken
 \, this is your chance to let us know! You will have the chance to respond
  to this survey each week so you can give us specific feedback about the m
 odule you just completed. \n\nFill out the anonymous survey below with yo
 ur feedback about the course so far. Please be honest and detailed in your
  feedback. Provide specific examples\, as appropriate. Specificity will he
 lp us make improvements to the course more than general or vague feedback.
  \n\nHere is an example of helpful feedback: "In Module 6\, I was confuse
 d about the instructions on [assignment title]." "I was unsure of what to 
 do about [assignment details that were confusing]."  \n\nHere is an examp
 le of less helpful feedback: "The instructions on assignments are confusin
 g."   \n\nRemember\, ALL surveys and feedback is anonymous\, and will no
 t affect your standing in this class.\n\n \n\nTip: Once you complete the 
 survey\, answer the quiz question appropriately to receive the extra credi
 t points.\n\n \n\n \n\n-------------\nImage Credits\n-------------\n\nMi
