DESCRIPTION:**************************************************\nLesson 6 C
 hoose-Your-Own Archaeological Adventure\n\n*******************************
 *******************\n\n[] (https://byu.instructure.com/courses/36994/files
 /13577542/download?download_frd=1&hidden=1)\n\n \n\nRemember you last adv
 enture? Just like last time\, you will choose a learning adventure that he
 lps you explore archeology. Take this as an opportunity to be a proactive 
 learner and select an adventure that interests you most.\n\n--------------
 -\n   Instructions\n---------------\n\nThroughout the semester you will 
 have 3 opportunities (2 required\, 1 for extra credit) to engage more with
  archaeology and the past by participating in a few activities meant to en
