 it your completed work in one of the following formats:\n\n* .doc\n\n* .do
 cx\n\nBe sure to follow all directions outlined in your adventure descript
 ion before submitting.\n\n \n\nImage Credits\n-------------\n\nMike Searc
 y\, Eagle's Watch 2\, Mike Searcy\, Used with Permission.\n\nModule Item C
 ompletion (browser only)\n\n 
